oment (. \u275b \u1d17 \u275b.)\n\nI'm really excited to see what you do, thank you so much!\n\nREFERENCES: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PDMnXQcW_R6A2JGkIG9FtLqjTE--GmwW?usp=sharing\n\nPinterest boards (if you need inspiration):\n\nweiyong: https://pinterest.com/680811SASA/%E4%BC%9F%E5%8B%87-weiyong/\n\nband (each board is an album): https://pinterest.com/ecranlenoir/", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 7565, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\ud83d\udc07", "screen_name": "u_arca_u", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1605160738108035072/YMZZmIvG.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1049340312571666436/1613799222/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 128}, {"id": 524100, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u516d\u85e4\u3042\u304d\u3065\ud83c\udf6eSkeb\u52df\u96c6\u4e2d", "screen_name": "rokufuji_m", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917245881335840768/zanzXMf7.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1212383390881632256/1664194340/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 916598, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "\u30df\u30b3\u30c8", "screen_name": "takoharamint", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1641994512179535872/6VDURX98.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_bann